        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://openmath.org/vocab/math/meta#Library"/>
        <OM-Math-Meta:description>This CD holds further functions concerning functions themselves. A
    particularly interesting function is

    apply_to_list

    which applies an nary function to all the elements in a specified
    list. For example, such a function can be used to form sums and
    products in conjunction with plus and times respectively.</OM-Math-Meta:description>
