amplitudes, such as voltage or pressure.
It has the short symbol form, &quot;Np&quot;.</OM-Math-Meta:description>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.openmath.org/cd/SIUsed_OffSystemUnits1"/>
