        <OM-Math-Meta:formalProperty rdf:nodeID="genid273"/>
        <OM-Math-Meta:commentedProperty>whenever not(a=0) then a/a = 1</OM-Math-Meta:commentedProperty>
        <OM-Math-Meta:description>This symbol represents a (binary) division function denoting the first argument
right-divided by the second, i.e. divide(a,b)=a*inverse(b). It is the
