effectively multiplied by $2^10$. The full technical name 
is kilobinary.</OM-Math-Meta:description>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.openmath.org/cd/units_binaryprefix1"/>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
